6.01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Копировать код</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-ts"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> { </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Component</span></span><span> } </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'@angular/core'</span></span><span>;
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> { </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">RouterLink</span></span><span> } </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'@angular/router'</span></span><span>;

</span><span><span class="hljs-meta">@Component</span></span><span>({
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">selector</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'app-home'</span></span><span>,
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">standalone</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-literal">true</span></span><span>,           </span><span><span class="hljs-comment">// 👈 обязательно указываем</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">imports</span></span><span>: [</span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">RouterLink</span></span><span>],      </span><span><span class="hljs-comment">// 👈 если используешь &lt;a routerLink=""&gt;</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">templateUrl</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'./home.html'</span></span><span>,
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">styleUrls</span></span><span>: [</span><span><span class="hljs-string">'./home.scss'</span></span><span>]  </span><span><span class="hljs-comment">// 👈 должно быть styleUrls (множественное)</span></span><span>
})
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Home</span></span><span> { }
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="668" data-end="671">
<h3 data-start="673" data-end="690">🔍 Пояснения:</h3>
<ol data-start="691" data-end="1104">
<li data-start="691" data-end="818">
<p data-start="694" data-end="818"><strong data-start="694" data-end="716"><code data-start="696" data-end="714">standalone: true</code></strong> — без этого Angular не поймёт, что компонент самостоятельный (в новой архитектуре это обязательно).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="819" data-end="922">
<p data-start="822" data-end="922"><strong data-start="822" data-end="837"><code data-start="824" data-end="835">styleUrls</code></strong> (во множественном числе) — Angular требует именно такое свойство, а не <code data-start="909" data-end="919">styleUrl</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="923" data-end="1104">
<p data-start="926" data-end="1104"><strong data-start="926" data-end="953"><code data-start="928" data-end="951">imports: [RouterLink]</code></strong> — если в шаблоне есть ссылки вида <code data-start="988" data-end="1013">&lt;a routerLink="/about"&gt;</code>, их нужно добавить.<br data-start="1033" data-end="1036">
Если нет маршрутов внутри — можешь оставить просто <code data-start="1090" data-end="1103">imports: []</code>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="1106" data-end="1109">
<p data-start="1111" data-end="1186">После этого компонент полностью валиден в Angular 20 без <code data-start="1168" data-end="1183">app.module.ts</code>.</p>
<p data-start="1188" data-end="1342" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Если хочешь, я покажу тебе такой же исправленный шаблон для второго компонента — например, <code data-start="1279" data-end="1289">about.ts</code>, чтобы у тебя всё было одинаково оформлено. Сделать?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Копировать" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.4