6.01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Копировать код</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-ts"><span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> { </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Home</span></span><span> } </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'./components/home/home'</span></span><span>;</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span></span><span> { </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Home</span></span><span> } </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'./components/home/home'</span></span><span>;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="441" data-end="493">Это вызывает ошибку <code data-start="461" data-end="490">Duplicate identifier 'Home'</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="495" data-end="671">
<p data-start="498" data-end="671">У тебя используются <strong data-start="518" data-end="569">имена <code data-start="526" data-end="541">HomeComponent</code>, <code data-start="543" data-end="559">AboutComponent</code> и т. д.</strong>,<br data-start="570" data-end="573">
но в проекте классы называются просто <code data-start="614" data-end="620">Home</code>, <code data-start="622" data-end="629">About</code>, <code data-start="631" data-end="641">Projects</code>, <code data-start="643" data-end="652">Contact</code>, <code data-start="654" data-end="668">PageNotFound</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="673" data-end="798">
<p data-start="676" data-end="798">Файл построен по старому принципу <code data-start="710" data-end="721">@NgModule</code>,<br data-start="722" data-end="725">
а в Angular 20 мы используем <strong data-start="757" data-end="783">standalone-архитектуру</strong> — без модулей.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="800" data-end="803">
<h2 data-start="805" data-end="845">✅ Исправленный вариант для Angular 20</h2>
<p data-start="847" data-end="902">Полностью замени содержимое <code data-start="875" data-end="890">app.routes.ts</code> вот на это:</p>
