  { </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">path</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'home'</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">component</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Home</span></span><span> },
  { </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">path</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'course/:id'</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">component</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">Course</span></span><span> },
  { </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">path</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'course-card'</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">component</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">CourseCard</span></span><span> },
  { </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">path</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'course-list'</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">component</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">CourseList</span></span><span> },
  { </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">path</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'**'</span></span><span>, </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">component</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-title class_">PageNotFound</span></span><span> },
];
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="798" data-end="801">
<h3 data-start="803" data-end="820">💡 Объяснение</h3>
<ul data-start="821" data-end="1202">
<li data-start="821" data-end="886">
<p data-start="823" data-end="886">✅ <code data-start="825" data-end="846">redirectTo: '/home'</code> — правильный редирект при пустом пути</p>
</li>
<li data-start="887" data-end="976">
<p data-start="889" data-end="976">✅ <code data-start="891" data-end="910">pathMatch: 'full'</code> — обязательно, чтобы редирект срабатывал только на точное <code data-start="969" data-end="974">'/'</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="977" data-end="1079">
<p data-start="979" data-end="1079">✅ <code data-start="981" data-end="993">course/:id</code> — динамический маршрут (для примера, если захочешь показывать страницу курса по ID)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1080" data-end="1152">
<p data-start="1082" data-end="1152">✅ Все компоненты подключены напрямую (standalone-подход Angular 20).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1153" data-end="1202">
<p data-start="1155" data-end="1202">✅ <code data-start="1157" data-end="1171">PageNotFound</code> — ловит несуществующие пути.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1204" data-end="1207">
