051 6.01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg>Копировать код</button></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre!"><span><span>Can</span><span><span class="hljs-string">'t bind to '</span></span><span>routerLinkActiveOptions</span><span><span class="hljs-string">' since it isn'</span></span><span>t a known </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">property</span></span><span> of </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'a'</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="210" data-end="354">означает, что в <code data-start="226" data-end="234">app.ts</code> (главный компонент приложения) <strong data-start="266" data-end="301">не подключены директивы роутера</strong>: <code data-start="303" data-end="317">RouterOutlet</code>, <code data-start="319" data-end="331">RouterLink</code>, <code data-start="333" data-end="351">RouterLinkActive</code>.</p>
<hr data-start="356" data-end="359">
<h3 data-start="361" data-end="378">✅ Исправление</h3>
<p data-start="380" data-end="453">Открой файл<br data-start="391" data-end="394">
📄 <code data-start="397" data-end="413">src/app/app.ts</code><br data-start="413" data-end="416">
и замени его содержимое на следующее:</p>
