  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">routerLink</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"/"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">routerLinkActive</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"active"</span></span><span> [</span><span><span class="hljs-attr">routerLinkActiveOptions</span></span><span>]=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"{ exact: true }"</span></span><span>&gt;Главная</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span>&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">routerLink</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"/about"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">routerLinkActive</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"active"</span></span><span>&gt;О компании</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span>&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">routerLink</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"/projects"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">routerLinkActive</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"active"</span></span><span>&gt;Проекты</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span>&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">routerLink</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"/contact"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">routerLinkActive</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"active"</span></span><span>&gt;Контакты</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span>&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">routerLink</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"/comments"</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">routerLinkActive</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"active"</span></span><span>&gt;Комментарии</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">a</span></span></span><span>&gt;
</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">nav</span></span></span><span>&gt;

</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">hr</span></span></span><span> /&gt;

</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">router-outlet</span></span></span><span>&gt;</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">router-outlet</span></span></span><span>&gt;
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1764" data-end="1859">Если этого тега нет, Angular просто не знает, куда вставить компонент при переходе по маршруту.</p>
<hr data-start="1861" data-end="1864">
<h3 data-start="1866" data-end="1890">✅ 3️⃣ После правок</h3>
<ol data-start="1891" data-end="1961">
<li data-start="1891" data-end="1910">
<p data-start="1894" data-end="1910">Сохрани файлы.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1911" data-end="1945">
<p data-start="1914" data-end="1945">Останови сервер (<code data-start="1931" data-end="1941">Ctrl + C</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1946" data-end="1961">
<p data-start="1949" data-end="1961">Перезапусти:</p>
</li>
</ol>
